# Keil uVision per-user state: debugger selection, breakpoints, window layout.
# The .uvprojx itself is checked in, this is not.
*.uvoptx

# The repository root .gitignore contains "*.BAT" (a Keil build-artifact
# convention).  Git matches that case-insensitively on Windows, so every
# one-key script in this project (build.bat, build_mdk.bat, test_logic.bat) was
# being dropped from the index *silently* - `git add` reports nothing, the file
# simply never appears in `git status` and never reaches a clone.
# Re-include them here; they are source, not artifacts.
!*.bat
